msgid "What this installation still leaves open"
msgstr ""

#: inc/settings.php:289
msgid "What happened"
msgstr ""

#: inc/settings.php:304
msgid "Nothing yet. Lockouts, blocked requests and sign-ins show up here."
msgstr ""

